{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mean\" title=\"Mean\">mean</a> value for 9 Math-tests that a student succeded was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (in scale <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />). If we put the grades of these tests in incresing order, then the maximum grade of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61dd763f18ffe5a0111b97ef837781a8455e1573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{th}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> test is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc0db555b021e196698e1f1cc3f53869d926263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 15\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 16\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 17\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 18\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the 5th test received a grade of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the minimum possible sum of the tests is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/2796a1fc5512f0efbfeefa72b804a146d9431d29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 + 0 + 0 + 0 + x + x + x + x + x = 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"309\" height=\"14\" />. The average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/4/1841a3ba280a31dd15bdcc03bef78a6297bc1a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5x}{9}=10\\rightarrow\\\\x=18 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19\" title=\"2007